  "_doc": "Skill folder names shipped by EARLIER @cometchat/skills / @cometchat/skills-native generations that this pack no longer ships. `add` removes exactly these from the target skills dir (remove-on-add), so a v4->v5 upgrade leaves no stale skills behind. It never removes a current-pack skill (another family, a calls peer, a --global install from another project) or any other folder (e.g. a user's own cometchat-* skill). When a release drops or renames a skill, append the old name here. Regenerate: every skills/*/SKILL.md and packages/*/skills/*/SKILL.md folder name in git history, minus `ls skills/`.",
